          "theme": "numbers_time",
          "text": "It is a busy day, and we check the time carefully. Fifty cents are in my hand. I see forty desks. Fourteen students are in the room. He is never late for school. Nineteen kids play outside. He sees ninety stars. Seventeen flowers are red. After reading, we choose two new words and make our own sentences.",
