        {
          "id": "l4-u02-p2",
          "title": "Numbers and Time: Second Reading",
          "type": "guided-reading",
          "theme": "numbers_time",
          "text": "It is a busy day, and we check the time carefully. She has seventy stickers. Sixteen ducks walk by. I see sixty dots. The bus will come soon. The baby is still asleep. Thirteen birds sit on the roof. She counts thirty coins. After reading, we choose two new words and make our own sentences.",
