          "type": "guided-reading",
          "theme": "people_family",
          "text": "My family and friends are together today. My grandfather walks every morning. My grandma smiles at me. My grandmother makes good soup. My grandpa drinks warm tea. My parents love our family. Excuse me, sir. Is this your bag? The writer makes funny stories. After reading, we choose two new words and make our own sentences.",
